tr = ctrl_attr.replace('_R','_L')\n                        \n            cmds.setAttr('{0}.{1}'.format(left_ctrl_name, ctrl_attr), get_values)\n        \n    cmds.copyKey(ctrl)\n    cmds.pasteKey(left_ctrl_name)\n\n\n\nmirror_key()\n\n\n\n\n" 
